{"id": "DerUBFSE1_P", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "How do your phone and a website agree on a secret when anyone can listen in? 🔐\n\nPicture paint. Both start with a public colour. Each secretly mixes in its own colour and they swap the mixes in the open. Then each adds its secret colour again, and both end up with the exact same colour. The eavesdropper only saw the mixes, and unmixing paint is practically impossible.\n\nThat's Diffie–Hellman key exchange (1976). Computers do it with one-way maths, and today's TLS 1.3 makes fresh keys for each connection.\n\nAnd the certificate, signed by an authority your phone trusts, proves the site owns that address.\n\nSo a padlock means private, not honest. Always check the address. 👀\n\nSend this to someone who trusts every padlock\n\n#cybersecurity #https #encryption #howtechworks #techexplained", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1792481406, "like_count": 13, "comment_count": 0, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18141784156575820a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 60.923, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQP-rilIHRpSqiI6lQM6attqz6afJ8aBELtmYHH-qvH26sU_M5H37SNRKLsT40vsTF0Ut-NX_HD8cAARBuZNhnDClvdwqKNrpjSu_hY.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=AdrlRVVWxi0eFdKCQ8hmc7qe9efoYNvQXiSboFTU8CteryJ-TzfBHoF02MAsUrlGyIctgiWCxwl7wrD8fg2f2hPn&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=Yv0Vbt_bsLgQ7kNvwHyB-4w&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=NPTWuycE5Q4EBNP7AXf4Uw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQezvg8h_E4hTQnqnPv9gaJMvhjicahjKm0aBrQP3KN9w&oe=6AF43017", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 60.923, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"Use